        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-11-01T12:47:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello again!</p>\n<p>You can convert the destruction into a push, but you then you don't get the later thresholds; see <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.7w4gee8\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this FAQ</a>.</p>\n<p>Interrupts are indeed quite rare, but that isn't happening here; Flowing and Silent Forms Dart By is an action modifier; see p. 25, around the middle.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:10:07.292Z",
