        "raw": "<p>Hello again!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can convert the destruction into a push, but you then you don't get the later thresholds; see <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.7w4gee8\">this FAQ</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Interrupts are indeed quite rare, but that isn't happening here; Flowing and Silent Forms Dart By is an action modifier; see p. 25, around the middle.</p>",
